{"id":5231,"type":"vertex","label":"hoverResult","result":{"contents":[{"language":"typescript","value":"(local function) header(name: string): string"},"Return request header.\n\nThe `Referrer` header field is special-cased,\nboth `Referrer` and `Referer` are interchangeable.\n\nExamples:\n\n    req.get('Content-Type');\n    // => \"text/plain\"\n\n    req.get('content-type');\n    // => \"text/plain\"\n\n    req.get('Something');\n    // => undefined\n\nAliased as `req.header()`."]}}
